  <html><head><title>The guide | Kara &amp; Friends</title>
  <h1 id="the-guide">The guide</h1>
  <h2 id="values-types">Values &amp; types</h2>
  <p>A <code>String</code> owns its text; a <code>Str</code> is a view: <code>&quot;a&quot; &lt; &quot;b&quot;</code> is <em>true</em>.</p>
  <h2 id="errors">Errors</h2>
  <p>Use <code>?</code> to propagate. Back to <a href="intro.html">the intro</a>, or the <a href="nowhere.html">missing page</a>.</p>
  <h2 id="is-it-fast">Is it fast?</h2>
  <h2 id="why-angle-brackets">Why &lt;angle brackets&gt;?</h2>
  <p>They are <em>escaped</em>: 1 &lt; 2 &amp;&amp; 3 &gt; 2.</p>
  <ul>
  <li>download the <code>karac</code> binary</li>
  <li>put it on your <code>PATH</code></li>
  <li>run <code>karac --version</code></li>
  </ul>
  <pre><code class="language-sh">karac build hello.kara
  ./hello
  </code></pre>
